elow. It is a variable, so it is saved with the notebook."],"id":"c05"},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"c06","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791291911097,"user_tz":-180,"elapsed":6,"user":{"displayName":"ÖMER ÇOLAK","userId":"16306115783918560316"}}},"execution_count":17,"outputs":[],"source":["prediction = 4,937 # write your prediction before running the next cell"],"id":"c06"},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"c07","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791291873191,"user_tz":-180,"elapsed":5,"user":{"displayName":"ÖMER ÇOLAK","userId":"16306115783918560316"}}},"execution_count":14,"outputs":[],"source":["# Cell 1\n","L = 1.0     # m\n","g = 9.81    # m/s^2 (Earth)"],"id":"c07"},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"c08","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791291875520,"user_tz":-180,"elapsed":16,"user":{"displayName":"ÖMER ÇOLAK","userId":"16306115783918560316"}},"outputId":"9f661218-2664-4590-8ff1-cd2120b6ca9d"},"execution_count":15,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["T = 2.006 s\n"]}],"source":["# Cell 2\n","T = 2 * math.pi * math.sqrt(L / g)\n","print(f\"T = {T:.3f} s\")"],"id":"c08"},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"c09","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791291917451,"user_tz":-180,"elapsed":17,"user":{"displayName":"ÖMER ÇOLAK","userId":"16306115783918560316"}}},"execution_count":18,"outputs":[],"source":["# Cell 3\n","g = 1.62    # m/s^2 (Moon experiment)"],"id":"c09"},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"c10"},"source":["**Now:** run cell 1, then cell 3, then cell 2. Write down what it prints. Then use **Runtime → Restart session and run all** (in some Colab versions the menu item reads *Restart and run all*) and compare."],"id":"c10"},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"c11"},"source":["**Compare.** Put your `prediction` next to the output above. Was it right? If not, say in one sentence which of your assumptions was wrong."]